brainSOL bundles the following libraries and fonts. Each keeps its own license; the texts are
in node_modules/<package>/LICENSE after an install. Versions are the ones this repository
installs from package.json, checked against the installed packages.

three 0.187.0: the 3D scene of the digital twin
MIT
https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js

uplot 1.6.32: the live charts
MIT
https://github.com/leeoniya/uPlot

suncalc 2.1.4: the position of the sun for the site in the browser
BSD 2-Clause
https://github.com/mourner/suncalc

uqr 0.1.3: the QR code that brings a phone to the live page
MIT
https://github.com/unjs/uqr
It contains code from Project Nayuki's QR code generator, MIT.

Two more are build tools rather than runtime dependencies, but what they produce ends up in
the site, so they belong here too:

svelte 5 and @sveltejs/kit 2: the framework, and the runtime it compiles into every
component. Both float on a caret range, so the installed version is whatever the lockfile
last resolved
MIT
https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte

tailwindcss 4: the reset the theme is built on, compiled into app.css
MIT
https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss

The font is self hosted. The file sits in src/lib/fonts and is copied into the build,
nothing is loaded from a font service:

Geist Serif 1.003 (GeistSerif-Regular.woff2): every text of the page, the wordmark included.
Taken unchanged from the geist package 1.9.2 on npm. The full license text is in
src/lib/fonts/OFL.txt
Copyright 2026 The Geist Project Authors
SIL Open Font License 1.1
https://github.com/vercel/geist-font
